      "y": -260,
      "width": 2400,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Paper §2 Framework — Evidence ⫨ Explanation 双层\n*笔记 §108 reframe · Zoom 1-4 hierarchy · 4×4 evidence sub-cells*\n**Reviewer 最忌 evidence-as-explanation** — 两层必须分写然后 explicit link\n\n📋 **2026-05-03 reframe**: paper hook 现在是 data-conditional (Hero P-SoM + Structural P-text/P-prompt + Framing rule R1-R5) — 见底部 reframe summary box 跟 [[preregistration]] / [[EVIDENCE_LAYER_AUDIT#§2]]"
    },

    {
      "id": "expl_grouplaaaaaaa",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 1980,
      "color": "6",
      "label": "EXPLANATION LAYER (因果假说, §2 主居所)"
    },

    {
      "id": "evi_grouplaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 1320,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "EVIDENCE LAYER (观测数据, §3 主居所) — 4 测量 × 4 cross-X = 16 sub-cells"
    },

    {
      "id": "prereg_summary00",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 📋 Pre-Registration Framework (2026-05-03)\n\n**(A) Hero**: P-SoM = deployment routing arm + 4-fold drop-in (gating, strict)\n**(B) Structural**: P-text/P-prompt 各有 unique non-overlap 对 P-SoM (gating, low-threshold)\n**(C) Post-hoc**: 别扭 + capability reversal (mark exploratory, not gating)\n**(D) Framing rule R1-R5**: data-conditional paper hook (R1 strongest → R5 paper death)"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom1aaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 1 — Architectural completeness (deductive, self-evidence)\n\n**Phantom routing space** (boundary: `axis 3 = no annotated image`)\n**4-fold drop-in**: (a)(b)(c) by-construction for ALL 4 corners; **(d) drop-one ≥1pp pre-registered for P-SoM hero only** (P-text/P-prompt 探索, see [[preregistration#H1]])\n\n```\nPREMISE: phantom 锁 image=✗ → input 仅 (prompt, obs 文本) 2-dim\nCONCLUSION: M1 + M2 by construction exhaustive — phantom space 内**无 hidden 3rd axis**\n```\n\n**关键性质**: deductive argument, 即使跑 100 corners 也不能反驳"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom2aaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 2 — Behavioral M1/M2 activation 2×2 (self-evidence)\n\n**M1 (Image-mirage)**: prompt 期 image → vision-grounded attention + language prior 填补缺席视觉\n**M2 (Flat-list)**: obs flat indexed list → tree-traversal → sequential list-scanning\n\n| Mode | M1 | M2 | LLM internal state |\n|---|:-:|:-:|---|\n| DOM | ❌ | ❌ | origin baseline |\n| P-text | ❌ | ✅ | M2 alone (Format-swap) |\n| P-prompt | ✅ | ❌ | M1 alone (Mirage subspace) |\n| **P-SoM ⭐** | ✅ | ✅ | **M1 ⊕ M2 compound** (cube center, paper hero) |\n\n**P-SoM 是 paper hero 的 mechanistic 理由**: 唯一同时 activate M1+M2 + nonlinear interaction (3 unique tasks B0 reddit emergent)"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom25aaaaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Zoom 2.5 — 别扭 reverse explanation ⏸️ provisional (lean §7 narrative use, NOT §2 main)\n\n**Forward (M1/M2)** = causal upstream (input change → activation)\n**Reverse (别扭)** = causal downstream (mismatch count → SR/FP rank prediction)\n\n2×2 grid by mismatch count: DOM 0 / P-text & P-SoM 1 / P-prompt 2 (compound)\n**Capability-modulated reversal** (paper §7 finding): 大 VLM (B0) 偏 text-axis 别扭 / 小 VLM (B1) 偏 image-axis 别扭\n\n⚠️ N=4 cells provisional pending 14-cell rerun statistical commit"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom3m1aaaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 3 — M1 (Image-mirage) lit anchors\n\n• **Mirage Effect** (Asadi 2026 Stanford): VLM 无图准确率达有图 70-80%\n• **Scaffold Effect** (Vu Balloccu 2026): prompt 仅提及 modality 解释 70-80% performance shift\n• **Cross-modal flow** (Kaduri): middle-layer attention store image info in query tokens\n\n**Q1 cross-VLM**: XLRS-Bench / Plan-and-Act / AgentRewardBench distraction phenomenon / Koh 2024 VWA 44% retention"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom3m2aaaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 3 — M2 (Flat-list) lit anchors\n\n• **Prompt-format sensitivity** (Sclar 2024 / Mishra 2022): minor format → major performance shift\n• **Tree-traversal vs list-scanning** (你 deep research SoM novelty doc)\n\n**Q3 first-work claim VERIFIED**: 'no study isolates SoM-style flat text as a standalone observation' — Phantom-SoM 首次系统性 SoM-text isolation, lit-verified novel\n\n**Q2 surprise**: DOM-id > SoM [N] referencing in some prompt-instruction settings"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom3m3aaaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 3 — M3 (Image bidirectional) Q5 6/6 complete ⭐\n\n**Bidirectional fusion** novel synthesis (Q5 综述 line 22):\n• **Image-over-text**: POPE (Li 2023) / CHAIR (saliency hijack)\n• **Text-over-vision**: Tong 2024 Eyes Wide Shut / BLINK 24-30% near random / WHOOPS / MM-Vet OCR\n• **Dual-axis benchmark**: HallusionBench (Guan 2024) / MMHal-Bench\n• **Mid-layer attention decay** (Liu 2025 Devils, dual-cause anchor)\n\n**Scaling law**: B0 long-traj text-over-vision drift / B1 dense-vision image-over-text"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom4aacaaaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 4 — Cross-modal flow (Kaduri)\n\n*model-agnostic probe*\n\nLayerwise attention probe 显示 middle-layer cross-modal flows enable image-like representations from query tokens\n\n→ **M1 axis activation 的 mechanistic 解释**\n\n*paper §8 future work, 不 self-probe*"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom4absteermoeeee",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 4 — SteerMoE (Fayyaz 2026 ICLR)\n\n**B0-side anchor**\n*MoE family, Qwen3-30B-A3B cousin*\n\nMoE LLM paired prompts 算 expert RD, alignment 集中 subset of experts → routing logits steering 可绕过\n\n→ B0 = Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B 是 SteerMoE 实验模型 architectural cousin\n\n**Methodology template** for paper sequence follow-up Zoom 4 self-probe"
    },

    {
      "id": "zoom4actoolcallinng",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Zoom 4 — Tool Calling Linear Circuit (Anon ACL 2026)\n\n**B1-side anchor** ⭐ NEW\n*Qwen3-4B 直接验证, 跟 B1 = Qwen3-VL-4B 是 architectural cousin*\n\nhidden-state PCA cosine gap 捕获 92% action-selection 错误; L23+ steering 80-93%; 'knows but cannot say'\n\n→ §1 cascade `DOM→P-text→P-SoM→SoM` 的 **mechanistic 理由** (action selection 线性可分 + argument generation 非线性)\n\n仅需 ~2300 forward pass 单卡 RTX 4090 24h"
    },

    {
      "id": "papersequenceaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1670,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Paper sequence implication (Zoom 4 future work)\n\n**主 paper (本)**: Zoom 1 ✅ / Zoom 2 ✅ / Zoom 3 ✅ (lit-anchored) / Zoom 4 标 future work, 不 self-probe\n\n**Follow-up paper (sequence sibling) — dual-tier**:\n• B0-side: SteerMoE-style expert RD (RunPod 4×4090 ~$400-600 cost)\n• **B1-side: Tool Calling hidden-state PCA (~2300 forward pass + 单卡 RTX 4090 24h, 几乎零成本) — NEW unlock 2026-05-01**"
    },

