      "text": "## ⚠️ Retract list (5 items, 不要再 use)\n\n• ❌ \"5-mode 沿 cube 对角路径\" + \"4 mismatched 排除 (parsing tax)\" 论证\n• ❌ 8-corner 2x2x2 cube factorial design 作 paper §2 axis\n• ❌ 6-corner asymmetric grid (a/b × c/¬c × 1/2)\n• ❌ (a)(c) prompt decomposition 作 axis (改用 mechanism activation)\n• ❌ \"Three-layer mechanism argument\" 命名 (改用 evidence/explanation 双层 + Zoom 1-4)\n\n*详 笔记 §108 chronicle + paper_planning §2 retract list*"
