    {
      "id": "reviewercaveatlbl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 3140,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## ⚠️ Reviewer Caveat — Evidence ≠ Explanation\n\n**Reviewer 最忌 evidence-as-explanation 混淆**: \"Macro × mode search-loop 51.9→35.7%\" 是 **evidence (data)**; \"M1 axis activates list-scanning trajectory\" 是 **explanation (Zoom 2 hypothesis)** — 两者必须分写然后 explicit link (\"the 35.7% search-loop suggests M2 flat-list activation, consistent with Zoom 2 hypothesis\")"
    }
